1
00:00:14,539 --> 00:00:18,719
Sun is slipping in the willows

2
00:00:18,719 --> 00:00:22,399
Water turning orange and grey

3
00:00:22,399 --> 00:00:25,140
Paper lanterns down the railing

4
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:29,199
Lighting up the end of day

5
00:00:29,199 --> 00:00:32,740
Miller sets his cider cup down

6
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:36,200
Draws the bow across the string

7
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:39,820
Folks are packing up the benches

8
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:43,659
Waiting for the tune to sing

9
00:00:43,659 --> 00:00:46,679
Crates are loaded on the pickup

10
00:00:46,679 --> 00:00:50,140
Shadows leaning on the sand

11
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:53,380
You walk right up through the clover

12
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:56,740
Red fall leaf inside your hand

13
00:00:59,060 --> 00:01:02,880
Let the young folks go running down the road

14
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:05,959
Let them race until they tire

15
00:01:05,959 --> 00:01:08,400
We’ll just take this wooden floor

16
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:12,799
And warm our hands beside the fire

17
00:01:12,799 --> 00:01:16,620
Two old boots in the pine sawdust

18
00:01:16,620 --> 00:01:19,939
Holding on and stepping light

19
00:01:19,939 --> 00:01:23,079
We’re dancing like nobody’s

20
00:01:23,079 --> 00:01:24,680
Young tonight

21
00:01:32,900 --> 00:01:37,579
You don't ask me if I want to

22
00:01:37,579 --> 00:01:39,879
No, you never ask at all

23
00:01:39,879 --> 00:01:43,819
Just reach out and take my fingers

24
00:01:43,819 --> 00:01:48,000
Pull me right off of the wall

25
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:51,560
You took off that tight old necktie

26
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:54,939
Hung it right across the post

27
00:01:54,939 --> 00:01:58,579
You’re the one I picked for dancing

28
00:01:58,579 --> 00:02:01,730
The one that I still love the most

29
00:02:01,730 --> 00:02:04,890
You step right upon my shoe sole

30
00:02:04,890 --> 00:02:08,039
Then you just look down and grin

31
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:11,900
Say you lost your count of three

32
00:02:11,900 --> 00:02:16,080
So you just turn us round again

33
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:19,840
Let the young folks go running down the road

34
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:22,680
Let them race until they tire

35
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:25,460
We’ll just take this wooden floor

36
00:02:25,460 --> 00:02:29,469
And warm our hands beside the fire

37
00:02:29,469 --> 00:02:33,469
Two old boots in the pine sawdust

38
00:02:33,469 --> 00:02:37,479
Holding on and stepping light

39
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:40,099
We’re dancing like nobody’s

40
00:02:40,099 --> 00:02:41,620
Young tonight

41
00:02:41,620 --> 00:02:47,080
Look at all them little crow's feet

42
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:51,139
Crinkling round your grey-green eyes

43
00:02:51,139 --> 00:02:54,780
Every winter that we made it through

44
00:02:54,780 --> 00:02:57,759
None of it told any lies

45
00:02:57,759 --> 00:03:01,159
Still that same look in your face

46
00:03:01,159 --> 00:03:04,979
Hasn't changed a single bit

47
00:03:04,979 --> 00:03:08,759
Like a stove pipe in the cabin

48
00:03:08,759 --> 00:03:11,900
When the evening wood is lit

49
00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:15,560
Water's splashing on the dock pilings

50
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:19,020
Stars are coming through the blue

51
00:03:19,020 --> 00:03:21,659
You pull me in by the elbow

52
00:03:21,659 --> 00:03:26,180
I smell the cider on you too

53
00:03:26,180 --> 00:03:29,639
Let the night come down the valley

54
00:03:29,639 --> 00:03:33,039
Let the breeze begin to blow

55
00:03:33,039 --> 00:03:36,759
We got plenty of wood under our feet

56
00:03:36,759 --> 00:03:39,500
And nowhere we have to go

57
00:03:53,639 --> 00:03:58,020
Let the young folks go running down the road

58
00:03:58,020 --> 00:04:00,759
Let them race until they tire

59
00:04:00,759 --> 00:04:03,620
We’ll just take this wooden floor

60
00:04:03,620 --> 00:04:08,060
And warm our hands beside the fire

61
00:04:08,060 --> 00:04:11,379
Two old boots in the pine sawdust

62
00:04:11,379 --> 00:04:15,240
Holding on and stepping light

63
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:18,319
We’re dancing like nobody’s

64
00:04:18,319 --> 00:04:20,759
Young tonight

65
00:04:20,759 --> 00:04:27,060
Dancing like nobody's young tonight

66
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:33,220
One more turn before we leave

67
00:04:33,220 --> 00:04:36,680
Down along the river shore

